      "text": "Opposite Party :- State Of U.P. And 3 Others\nCounsel for Applicant :- Dhirendra Kumar Pal\nCounsel for Opposite Party :- G.A.\nHon'ble Manoj Bajaj,J.\nApplicant has filed this application under Section 447 B.N.S.S., 2023 seeking transfer of Criminal\nCase No.4677 of 2024, titled State Vs. Nirdesh and others, arising out of case crime no.283 of 2018,\nunder Sections 323, 498A Ipc and U/s 3/4 D.P. Act, Police Station Kishani, District Mainpuri,\npending in the court of A.C.J.M. Ist, Mainpuri to the competent court of District Auraiya.",
