      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Further,\nreliance is placed upon on a medical prescription dated 28th February, 2018 to contend that the applicant- complainant is suffering from Gynecological problem.",
